WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:03,850
Eat it, this is yours

2
00:00:04,170 --> 00:00:15,800
Fighting is a fight. Eat is a fight. Aren't you hungry? Sir, bear the hunger. Remember. No. No.

3
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:17,000
I won’t dare to do it next time

4
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:19,060
Brother Lin Feng

5
00:00:20,180 --> 00:00:21,100
You pissed me off

6
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:22,980
Are you not really angry with me?

7
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:30,180
listen to this noise

8
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:34,040
It’s so hard to endure, Sister Lin Nuo, are you envious?

9
00:00:34,560 --> 00:00:35,560
What do I envy?

10
00:00:35,840 --> 00:00:36,760
when i was punished

11
00:00:36,880 --> 00:00:40,580
But there are people who have more Yin Qi than him

12
00:00:40,580 --> 00:00:42,260
Last time I cried half blood while holding the water tank.

13
00:00:42,740 --> 00:00:43,860
Mine was blown by the wind

14
00:00:45,950 --> 00:00:49,100
Isn't it just an egg that will cure it, sister?

15
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:50,260
Didn't you see it?

16
00:00:50,660 --> 00:00:52,260
Fight to fight, eat to eat

17
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:55,580
Lin Feng gave his share to Xiaotang without touching a single bite.

18
00:00:55,900 --> 00:01:09,970
When you've cried enough, come over and eat. Don't cry until you've had enough.

19
00:01:10,170 --> 00:01:11,250
It's sand that got into my eyes

20
00:01:11,530 --> 00:01:12,770
Okay, sand got in your eyes.

21
00:01:12,770 --> 00:01:17,900
You’re still good enough to understand Huangsha, right?
